# এক "one, a" before a day part makes the phrase indefinite: H.-R. Thompson,
# Bengali (LOALL 18, John Benjamins 2012), "akta sundor sokal a beautiful
# morning"; the classifier forms একটা and একটি are the same numeral.
এক
একটা
একটি
# কাল, কালকে and পরশু name a day in either direction: Thompson, "kal tomorrow,
# yesterday, kalke tomorrow, yesterday".  Before a day part they would move
# it to an unknown day, so the phrase is refused (issue #1484).
কাল
কালকে
পরশু
